Source: flatpark-archive-keyring
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Komh <mail@guojing.io>
Standards-Version: 4.7.3
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), gpg
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/flatpark/debian-pkg

Package: flatpark-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: apt.flatpark.org archive key and apt source
 Installs the OpenPGP key that signs https://apt.flatpark.org and the
 deb822 source pointing apt at it. Key rotations reach users through
 upgrades of this package.
